{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-05-17 16:05:00', 'title': 'DELISTING OF SECURITIES OF GWG HOLDINGS, INC. FROM\xa0THE\xa0NASDAQ STOCK MARKET', 'text': "NEW YORK, MAY 17, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL DELIST THE COMMON STOCK OF GWG HOLDINGS, INC. GWG HOLDINGS, INC.'S COMMON STOCK WAS SUSPENDED ON APRIL 29, 2022, AND HAS NOT TRADED ON NASDAQ SINCE THAT TIME."}{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-05-17 02:30:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ LAUNCHES DIGITAL EDUCATION PROGRAM TO INCREASE KNOWLEDGE OF EQUITY DERIVATIVES', 'text': 'STOCKHOLM, SWEDEN, MAY 17, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ (NASDAQ: NDAQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF NASDAQ DERIVATIVES ACADEMY IN THE NORDICS. THE SET OF TRAINING PROGRAMS, DEVELOPED FOR NASDAQ BY LEADING EDUCATIONAL PARTNERS, ADDRESSES THE GROWING INTEREST AMONG BOTH INVESTMENT PROFESSIONALS AND RETAIL INVESTORS TO UTILIZE EQUITY DERIVATIVES AND AIMS TO INCREASE KNOWLEDGE ABOUT THE OPPORTUNITIES AND RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH TRADING THE ASSET.'}